[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923288737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116452#issuecomment-3923288737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116452","id":3923288737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7p2KKh","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T21:21:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T21:21:23Z","body":"The difference in behaviour between the `**` operator and the `pow` function are because `pow` has two `float` parameters, so the two `int` arguments are implicitly cast to `float`.\n<img width=\"330\" height=\"105\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3fbd9eb3-79ae-4048-9716-8d6eba2b2cb8\" />\n\nThe operation `2 ** -1` returns 0 instead of 0.5 because it performs integer exponentiation. Similarly, `1 / 2` returns 0 instead of 0.5.\n\nIt does seem that most other languages (including Python, Ruby and JavaScript) perform float exponentiation when evaluating `2 ** -1`.\n\n```py\n# Python\nprint(2 ** -1) # 0.5\nprint(1 / 2) # 0.5\n```\n```rb\n# Ruby\nputs(2 ** -1) # 1/2\nputs(1 / 2) # 0\n```\n```gdscript\n# GDScript\nprint(2 ** -1) # 0\nprint(1 / 2) # 0\n```\n```js\n// JavaScript\nconsole.log(2 ** -1); // 0.5\nconsole.log(1 / 2); // 0.5\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923288737/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923555194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116452#issuecomment-3923555194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116452","id":3923555194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7p3LN6","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T22:31:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T22:31:46Z","body":"As explained above this is the expected behavior as GDScript operators works similar as C++. You can see more here: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#operators","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923555194/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]